{"id":29606,"date":"2023-10-24T14:48:03","date_gmt":"2023-10-24T13:48:03","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=29606"},"modified":"2026-08-21T08:55:40","modified_gmt":"2026-08-21T07:55:40","slug":"maratona-de-berlim-2025","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-berlim-2025\/","title":{"rendered":"Maratona de Berlim 2025"},"content":{"rendered":"<div class=\"pr-expired-notice\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15) 0%, rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.6) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.35); border-radius: 16px; padding: 18px 24px; margin-bottom: 24px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex: 1; min-width: 260px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f<\/span><div><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 15px; font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;\">Esta edi\u00e7\u00e3o j\u00e1 decorreu.<\/strong><p style=\"font-size: 13.5px; color: #CBD5E1; margin: 2px 0 0 0;\">Consulta os resultados desta prova abaixo ou acede a todos os detalhes da edi\u00e7\u00e3o atual.<\/p><\/div><\/div><a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-de-berlim\/\" style=\"background: #8B5CF6 !important; color: #FFFFFF !important; font-weight: 700 !important; font-size: 13.5px !important; text-decoration: none !important; padding: 11px 22px !important; border-radius: 10px !important; white-space: nowrap !important; display: inline-flex !important; align-items: center !important; justify-content: center !important; height: 42px !important; margin: 0 !important; border: none !important; line-height: 1 !important; box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.4) !important;\">Ver Edi\u00e7\u00e3o Atual &rarr;<\/a><\/div>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A Maratona de Berlim, conhecida como &#8220;Berlin Marathon,&#8221; ocorre a 21 de Setembro de 2025. A primeira edi\u00e7\u00e3o da maratona foi realizada em 1974, e desde ent\u00e3o, tornou-se uma das maratonas mais ic\u00f3nicas e procuradas pelos corredores de elite e amadores.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A Maratona de Berlim \u00e9 famosa por seu percurso plano e veloz, o que a torna um local popular para tentativas de quebra de recordes mundiais. V\u00e1rios recordes mundiais masculinos e femininos foram estabelecidos nesta corrida ao longo dos anos, devido \u00e0s condi\u00e7\u00f5es favor\u00e1veis do percurso.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">O percurso leva os corredores a passar por algumas das principais atra\u00e7\u00f5es de Berlim, incluindo o Port\u00e3o de Brandemburgo, a Avenida Unter den Linden, a Ilha dos Museus e o Bairro de Charlottenburg. A Maratona de Berlim \u00e9 conhecida por sua organiza\u00e7\u00e3o eficiente e pela atmosfera vibrante ao longo do percurso, com muitos espectadores incentivando os corredores.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A Maratona de Berlim faz parte das World Marathon Majors, um grupo de seis das maratonas mais prestigiadas do mundo, que inclui tamb\u00e9m as maratonas de Boston, Londres, Chicago, Nova Iorque e T\u00f3quio. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":29607,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,31],"event_type_2":[1056,627],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[1096],"class_list":["post-29606","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-berlim-alemanha","event_type-corrida","event_type-maratona","event_type_2-alemanha","event_type_2-europa","event_type_5-majors"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/csm_bmw-berlin-marathon-2022-masse-start_529e8f5296-1.jpg","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/29606","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=29606"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/29606\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":61013,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/29606\/revisions\/61013"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/29607"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=29606"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=29606"},{"taxonomy":"event_type","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type?post=29606"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_2","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_2?post=29606"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_3","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_3?post=29606"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_4","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_4?post=29606"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_5","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_5?post=29606"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}